Hello,

the PreviousMapFeatureGenerator remebers the last outcome (Begin of 
name, Inside a name,
outside a name) for a token in all previous sentences. It shoud be 
cleared after the end of a document
with a call to the name finders clearAdaptivData method.

Jörn

